    {
      "source": "<li><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">Description</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-summary\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Summary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-detail\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Details</a>\n<ol class=\"toc-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#findOne(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">findOne(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">findAll(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Example,org.springframework.data.domain.Sort)\" tabindex=\"0\">findAll(Example, Sort)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#count(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">count(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#exists(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">exists(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#findBy(org.springframework.data.domain.Example,java.util.function.Function)\" tabindex=\"0\">findBy(Example, Function)</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>",
      "translation": "<li><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">描述</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-summary\" tabindex=\"0\">方法摘要</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-detail\" tabindex=\"0\">方法详情</a>\n<ol class=\"toc-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#findOne(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">findOne(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">findAll(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Example,org.springframework.data.domain.Sort)\" tabindex=\"0\">findAll(Example, Sort)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#count(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">count(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#exists(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">exists(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#findBy(org.springframework.data.domain.Example,java.util.function.Function)\" tabindex=\"0\">findBy(Example, Function)</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a single entity matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a> if none was found.</dd>\n<dt>Throws:</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</a></code> - via <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#error(java.lang.Throwable)\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.error(Throwable)</code></a> if the\n          example yields more than one result.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - 不得为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个与给定 <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Example</code></a> 匹配的实体，或者如果未找到则返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"reactor.core.publisher 中的类或接口\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>抛出：</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException.html\" title=\"org.springframework.dao 中的类或接口\">IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</a></code> - 如果示例产生多于一个结果，则通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#error(java.lang.Throwable)\" title=\"reactor.core.publisher 中的类或接口\"><code>Mono.error(Throwable)</code></a> 抛出。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>sort</code> - the <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> specification to sort the results by, may be <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html#unsorted()\"><code>Sort.unsorted()</code></a>, must not be\n         null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>all entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - 不得为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>sort</code> - 用于对结果进行排序的 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 规范，可以是 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html#unsorted()\"><code>Sort.unsorted()</code></a>，不得为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>所有匹配给定 <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 的实体。</dd>",
      "count": 1
